  "bodyHash": "lSFcu31RQhE=",
  "content": "你好世界<p align=\"center\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/31qnTHav/images/9bcdf20013cd9ac82325a0b7c3540ddf05644af9.png\"/>\n</p>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/Diversity\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <img alt=\"github\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/github_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diversity\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <img alt=\"curseforge\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/faewufs-diversity\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <img alt=\"modrinth\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\"> \n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://faewulf.xyz/discord/\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <img alt=\"discord-singular\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n</div>\n\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n    <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/faewulf\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <img alt=\"kofi-singular\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/faewulf\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <img alt=\"paypal-singular\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/paypal-singular_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n</div>\n\n---\n\n# 📖 模組概述\n\nDiversity 是一款為 Minecraft 增添多樣化功能的模組，從生活品質改善到新生物行為應有盡有。本模組設計為可僅在伺服器端運作。\n\n| **現有功能**: 68 (+1 最新版本)  |\n| --- |\n\n\n### `2.4.0` 版本新增內容？\n\n- 甘蔗現在可以生長/放置在具有 diversity:strong_support_sugarcane 標籤的方塊上，不再需要附近有水。預設方塊：泥巴、泥濘紅樹林根。\n- 現在需要安裝 `Faewulf's Lib` 作為函式庫依賴。造成不便敬請見諒。\n- `烽火台擴展` 模組讓烽火台範圍和效果持續時間超越第4級！每超過一層增加20格範圍，最高可達第10級。\n- 新增 `日夜計數器` 選項可調整白天時間刻度（僅建議了解原理的玩家調整）。\n- 狐狸吃漿果後會自動繁殖。\n- 新增兩種背包附魔：`真空吸取`（自動吸取新拾取物品）和`選擇性吸取`（僅吸取背包內已有物品）。\n- `望遠鏡偵測功能` 新增更多設定選項（偵測範圍、顯示資訊、距離、名稱等）。\n- `禁止鞍具生物遊蕩`（取代`禁止馴服馬匹遊蕩`）現在影響所有可裝備鞍具的生物（支援模組生物）。\n\n### ⚠️ 1.20.1 版本注意事項\n原版模組是為 1.21 設計，`1.20.1` 回溯版本將缺少部分功能且無重新加入計劃：\n- 1刻延遲燈泡方塊\n- 隨機尺寸魚類\n- 更小的蜜蜂\n- 錘子旋轉方塊\n- 自訂附魔非數據驅動，需停用以實現純伺服器端運作（或需客戶端同步安裝）\n\n# ✨ 特色功能\n\n### 額外合成配方\n\n<details>\n  <summary>背包合成配方</summary>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/recipes/bundleRecipe.png?raw=true\" alt=\"背包合成\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>可疑的沙/礫石</summary>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/recipes/susSand.png?raw=true\" alt=\"可疑的沙\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/recipes/susGravel.png?raw=true\" alt=\"可疑的礫石\">\n</details>\n\n### 生活品質改善\n\n<details>\n  <summary>1刻延遲銅燈泡（預設關閉）（僅1.21）</summary>\n  <p>使銅燈泡方塊延遲1刻如同快照版。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/1tickdelayBulbBlock-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"1刻延遲燈泡\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>備用保護附魔（1.21版僅伺服器端有效）</summary>\n  <p>新增四種弱化版保護附魔，效果相同但僅25%強度。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/backup_enchantment.png?raw=true\" alt=\"備用附魔預覽\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/backup_enchantment-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"備用附魔展示\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>骨粉催生珊瑚</summary>\n  <p>在溫暖海洋生態域可用骨粉催生珊瑚扇/方塊形成珊瑚礁</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/bonemealCoral.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"骨粉催生珊瑚\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>骨粉催生小花</summary>\n  <p>種植在菌絲土的小花（除凋零玫瑰和火炬花）可用骨粉擴散</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/bonemealSmallFlower.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"骨粉催生小花\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>`烽火台擴展` </summary>\n  <p>突破烽火台4層限制！每超出一層增加20格範圍，最高可達10層。</p>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>戰利品旗幟</summary>\n  <p>新增類不祥旗幟的戰利品旗幟，可透過Boss掉落、牧羊人村民禮物等取得</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/trophyBanner.png?raw=true\" alt=\"戰利品旗幟\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>背包附魔（1.21版僅伺服器端有效）</summary>\n  <p>新增2種背包附魔（自動補充與容量擴充）。客戶端安裝時會正確顯示槽位指示。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/bundleEnchantment-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"背包附魔\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>強化附魔台</summary>\n  <p>附魔台可偵測2格外的書櫃並穿透非固體方塊</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/expandedEnchatingTable.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"擴展附魔台\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>穿透點擊牆上告示牌與物品展示框</summary>\n  <p>手持物品時可穿透告示牌/展示框直接點擊後方容器（需潛行才能旋轉物品/編輯告示牌）</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/clickThrough.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"穿透點擊\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>日夜計數器</summary>\n  <p>記錄遊戲內經過的天數</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/day_counter-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"日夜計數\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>深板岩生成器</summary>\n  <p>Y=8以下岩層接觸岩漿+水會轉化為深板岩</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/deepslate_generator-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"深板岩生成\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>隱形物品展示框</summary>\n  <p>潛行+右鍵用無色玻璃板可使展示框隱形（持有物品時保持隱形，否則顯示粒子效果）</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/invisibleItemFrame.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"隱形展示框\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>加速銅方塊氧化</summary>\n  <p>雨水和水中銅方塊氧化速度加快</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/fasterOxidization.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"加速氧化\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>加速礦車</summary>\n  <p>鋪設在礫石上的鐵軌會提升礦車速度</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/fasterMinecart.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"加速礦車\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>發光莓果給予發光效果</summary>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/glow-berries_glow-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"發光莓果效果\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>界伏盒標籤顯示</summary>\n  <p>放置時會顯示自訂名稱的界伏盒</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/shulkerLabel.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"界伏盒標籤\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>可填充的空可疑沙/礫石</summary>\n  <p>可潛行右鍵將物品放入空的可疑方塊</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/usableSusBlock.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"可疑方塊填充\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>無經驗限制鐵砧</summary>\n  <p>移除鐵砧\"過於昂貴\"限制（客戶端仍會顯示但可正常使用，需雙端安裝修正顯示）</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/no_level_limit_anvil.png?raw=true\" alt=\"無限制鐵砧\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>防耕地踐踏</summary>\n  <p>穿著緩降靴或擁有緩降效果時不會踐踏耕地</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/farmlandTrampling.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"防耕地踐踏\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>作物經驗</summary>\n  <p>收穫作物獲得經驗</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/xpCrops.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"作物經驗\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>睡眠不設重生點</summary>\n  <p>潛行右鍵床可跳過重生點設定</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/skipSetSpawnPoint.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"跳過重生點設定\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>火炬點燃目標</summary>\n  <p>持有火炬/靈魂火炬攻擊可點燃目標</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/torch_fire_attack-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"火炬點燃\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>睡眠不跳過天氣（預設關閉）</summary>\n<p>\n  <br>睡眠不再清除天氣。<br>RAIN_ONLY模式保留降雨<br>ALL_WEATHER模式保留雷雨（此模式下雷暴時無法睡眠）\n</p>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>清洗地圖</summary>\n  <p>用煉藥鍋清洗已探索地圖</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/washingFilledmap.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"清洗地圖\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>潛行穿越甜莓叢</summary>\n  <p>潛行通過甜莓叢不受傷害</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/sneakingSweetBerry.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"潛行甜莓\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>褲裝防甜莓</summary>\n  <p>穿著褲子可防甜莓叢傷害</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/sneakingSweetBerry.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"褲裝防護\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>加速開採玻璃/螢光石</summary>\n  <p>鎬類工具加速開採玻璃類方塊與螢光石</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/glassblockMining.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"加速開採\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>四元素畫作</summary>\n  <p>生存模式可放置2x2四元素畫作</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/elementPaintings.png?raw=true\" alt=\"四元素畫\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>濕海綿乾燥</summary>\n  <p>溫暖生態域中的濕海綿會逐漸乾燥</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/wetsponge_dry_warmbiome-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"海綿乾燥\">\n</details>\n\n### 物品調整\n\n<details>\n  <summary>背包放置方塊</summary>\n  <p>手持背包潛行左擊地面切換放置模式，可放置背包內方塊</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/item/bundlePlaceBlocks-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"背包放置\">\n  </details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>鋤頭範圍收割</summary>\n  <p>鋤頭可範圍收割作物（預設3x3，鑽石/獄髓鋤5x5）</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/item/AutoHarvest.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"範圍收割\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>錘子旋轉方塊（僅1.21）</summary>\n  <p>潛行右鍵用錘子旋轉定向方塊</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/item/maceRotateBlocks-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"錘子旋轉\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>剪刀拆除TNT</summary>\n  <p>對點燃的TNT使用剪刀有機率拆除</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/item/shearDefuseTNT.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"剪刀拆彈\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>剪刀扒竊村民</summary>\n  <p>潛行使用`剪刀`扒竊村民。<br/>\n正面扒竊易激怒村民，背後或隱形藥水可降低風險。<br/>\n扒竊可能重置職業，職業等級越高重置機率越低。\n  </p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/item/pickpocketVillager.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"扒竊村民\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>剪刀抑制植物生長</summary>\n  <p>對樹苗、竹子、藤蔓和甘蔗使用可阻止生長</p>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/item/shearPreventPlantGrow.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"抑制生長\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>望遠鏡偵測功能",
